flowchart TD
    Start([Start Risk Assessment]) --> Type{Risk Source}
    
    Type -->|Manual| Manual[User Identifies Risk]
    Type -->|AI Discovered| AI_Disc[AI Auto-Discovery]
    Type -->|BIA Derived| BIA_Risk[From BIA Analysis]
    
    Manual --> Describe[Describe Risk]
    AI_Disc --> Describe
    BIA_Risk --> Describe
    
    Describe --> Impact[Assess Impact<br/>1-5 Scale]
    Impact --> Likelihood[Assess Likelihood<br/>1-5 Scale]
    
    Likelihood --> AI_Analyze[AI Analysis]
    AI_Analyze --> Heatmap[Position on Risk Heatmap]
    
    Heatmap --> Priority{Risk Level}
    Priority -->|High 15-25| Critical[Critical - Immediate Action]
    Priority -->|Medium 8-14| Moderate[Moderate - Plan Required]
    Priority -->|Low 1-7| Low[Low - Monitor]
    
    Critical --> Mitigate[Define Mitigation]
    Moderate --> Mitigate
    Low --> Monitor[Add to Watch List]
    
    Mitigate --> AI_Suggest[AI Mitigation Suggestions]
    AI_Suggest --> Strategy[Select Strategy]
    
    Strategy --> Assign[Assign Owner]
    Assign --> Timeline[Set Timeline]
    Timeline --> Save[Save Risk]
    
    Save --> Notify[Notify Stakeholders]
    Monitor --> Save
    
    Notify --> Event[EventBus: Risk.Created]
    Event --> Done([Risk Registered])
    
    style Start fill:#4CAF50
    style Critical fill:#F44336
    style Moderate fill:#FF9800
    style Low fill:#FFEB3B
    style AI_Analyze fill:#2196F3
    style AI_Suggest fill:#2196F3
    style Done fill:#4CAF50